        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Scarf of embroidered silk in metal thread, Turkey, 1800-1825"@en , "Scarf of embroidered silk. Triangular with a border banded in silver strip. The floral design has stems in silver and blooms in red, pink and blue. The leaves are green, and the design is carried out in chain stitch. There is a floral spray in each corner."@en ;
